AudioScope 0.1.0 — modified version, 2026-10-05.
Package dev.audioscope; independent name, icon and interface.

This software is a fork / edited derivative of ShizuCallRecorder and CallVault.
https://github.com/kitsumed/ShizuCallRecorder
https://github.com/madkongo/CallVault

Playback AudioPolicy reflection, on-device ADB identity persistence and
detached Binder delivery were adapted from CallVault, upstream source commit
8ef410766e05f5b0eec3d83da4cbd3faf29728de, copyright The CallVault Authors.
Original attribution and the upstream Section 7 terms are retained in LICENSE
and displayed in the application Settings/About section.

AudioScope modifications: Material 3 UI, selectable accents, manual capture
catalog, live monitoring and waveform rows, recording controls, timestamped PCM
pipes, signal health, per-source formats, WAV/routing/Matroska exports and labs.

